<title>USA: ALPINE SKIING-TOP 10 IN FIRST RUN OF MEN'S CUP SLALOM.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-TOP 10 IN FIRST RUN OF MEN'S CUP SLALOM.</headline>
<dateline>PARK CITY, Utah 1996-11-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the 10</p>
<p>fastest skiers in the first run of the men's World Cup slalom</p>
<p>at Park City Sunday:</p>
<p>1. Thomas Sykora (Austria) 51.49</p>
<p>2. Thomas Stangassinger (Austria) 51.82</p>
<p>3. Christin Mayer (Austria) 52.20</p>
<p>4. Michael Tritscher (Austria) 52.36</p>
<p>5. Ole Christian Furuseth (Norway) 52.50</p>
<p>6. Fabio De Crignis (Italy) 52.68</p>
<p>7. Tom Stiansen (Norway) 52.82</p>
<p>8. Andrej Miklavc (Slovenia) 52.87</p>
<p>9. Kjetil Andre Aamodt (Norway) 52.97</p>
<p>10. Jure Kosir (Slovenia) 53.11</p>
</text>
